# Suppression des objectifs d'épargne : plus de route, plus de champ, les écritures marchent (CA1, CA2, CA3, CA7).
# Lancement : npx httpyac send --all http/suppression-epargne.http --var port=8080 --var anon=<ANON_KEY de `supabase status`>
# (la clé vient de la ligne de commande, jamais du fichier ; l'utilisateur est jetable, créé par le fichier)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{port}}
@authUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54321/auth/v1

### Utilisateur jetable
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "epargne-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Compte jetable
# @name account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "epargne-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "0" }

?? status == 201

### Second compte (virement)
# @name account2
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "epargne-bis-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "0" }

?? status == 201

### CA1 : GET /savings-goals n'existe plus
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/savings-goals
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 404

### CA1 : POST /savings-goals n'existe plus
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/savings-goals
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Vacances", "targetAmount": "100000" }

?? status == 404

### CA3 : savingsGoalId refusé à la création
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-01", "description": "avec objectif", "amount": "-1000", "savingsGoalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

?? status == 400

### CA2 : transaction créée sans le champ, réponse sans savingsGoalId
# @name tx
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-01", "description": "sans objectif", "amount": "-1000" }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.savingsGoalId == undefined
?? body contains "amount":"-1000"

### CA7 : modification (upsert_transactions)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions/{{tx.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "modifiée", "amount": "-2500" }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "amount":"-2500"
?? js response.parsedBody.savingsGoalId == undefined

### CA7 : virement (insert_transactions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "destinationAccountId": "{{account2.id}}", "amount": "5000", "date": "2026-10-02", "description": "virement" }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 2

### CA7 : import en lot
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactions": [
  { "date": "2026-10-03", "description": "lot 1", "amount": "-100" },
  { "date": "2026-10-04", "description": "lot 2", "amount": "-200" },
  { "date": "2026-10-05", "description": "lot 3", "amount": "300" }
] }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 3

### CA7 : récurrente pour la période
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/recurring
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "loyer", "amount": "-65000", "dayOfMonth": 5 }

?? status == 201

### CA7 : période avec injectRecurring (insert_transactions via create_period_with_budgets)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-11-01", "endDate": "2026-11-30", "budgets": [], "injectRecurring": true }

?? status == 201
